    "details": {
      "cr": {
        "base": 12
      },
      "alignment": "ce",
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>An incubus who fled the Worldwound through the failed Wardstone border with his little cast of demons, and found what looked like a perfect hiding place. Celmak treats them as \"regular cast.\" He wants out, with as much loot as he can carry.</p>"
      },
      "notes": {
        "value": "<div class=\"hg-journal\"><h3>Printed stat block</h3><section class=\"hg-statblock\"><h4 class=\"hg-sb-title\">VLATHHEREX — CR 12</h4><p><strong>XP</strong> 19,200 · Male incubus fighter 6 · CE Medium outsider (chaotic, demon, evil, extraplanar)</p><p><strong>Init</strong> +6; <strong>Senses</strong> darkvision 60 ft.; Perception +21</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">DEFENSE</h5><p><strong>AC</strong> 28, touch 14, flat-footed 26 (+7 armor, +2 deflection, +2 Dex, +7 natural)</p><p><strong>hp</strong> 147 (14d10+70)</p><p><strong>Fort</strong> +18, <strong>Ref</strong> +11, <strong>Will</strong> +13 (+2 vs. fear)</p><p><strong>Defensive Abilities</strong> bravery +2; <strong>DR</strong> 10/cold iron or good; <strong>Immune</strong> electricity, poison; <strong>Resist</strong> acid 10, cold 10, fire 10; <strong>SR</strong> 17</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">OFFENSE</h5><p><strong>Speed</strong> 30 ft., fly 50 ft. (average)</p><p><strong>Melee</strong> <em>+1 unholy scimitar</em> +23/+18/+13 (1d6+10/15–20)</p><p><strong>Special Attacks</strong> pain redoubled (DC 19), weapon training (heavy blades +1)</p><p><strong>Spell-Like Abilities</strong> (CL 8th; concentration +13)<br>Constant — <em>tongues</em><br>At will — <em>charm person</em> (DC 16), <em>detect thoughts</em> (DC 17), <em>greater teleport</em> (self plus 50 lbs. of objects only), <em>suggestion</em> (DC 18)<br>1/day — <em>crushing despair</em> (DC 19), summon (level 3, 2 schirs 40%)</p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">STATISTICS</h5><p><strong>Str</strong> 22, <strong>Dex</strong> 15, <strong>Con</strong> 18, <strong>Int</strong> 16, <strong>Wis</strong> 15, <strong>Cha</strong> 21</p><p><strong>Base Atk</strong> +14; <strong>CMB</strong> +20; <strong>CMD</strong> 34</p><p><strong>Feats</strong> Dazzling Display, Flyby Attack, Improved Critical (scimitar), Improved Initiative, Lightning Reflexes, Power Attack, Shatter Defenses, Toughness, Vital Strike, Weapon Focus (scimitar), Weapon Specialization (scimitar)</p><p><strong>Skills</strong> Bluff +18, Diplomacy +18, Fly +13, Intimidate +26, Knowledge (planes) +14, Perception +21, Sense Motive +15</p><p><strong>Languages</strong> Abyssal, Celestial, Common; telepathy 100 ft., <em>tongues</em></p><p><strong>SQ</strong> armor training 1, change shape (Small or Medium humanoid; <em>alter self</em>)</p><p><strong>Gear</strong> <em>+3 mithral chain shirt</em>, <em>+1 unholy scimitar</em>, <em>amulet of natural armor +1</em>, <em>belt of giant strength +2</em>, <em>cloak of resistance +3</em>, <em>ring of protection +2</em></p><h5 class=\"hg-sb-section\">SPECIAL ABILITIES</h5><p><strong>Pain Redoubled (Su)</strong> When Vlathherex confirms a critical hit with a melee weapon, the attack deals an extra 2d6 nonlethal damage, and the target must succeed at a DC 19 Fortitude save or be sickened for 1d6 rounds. Multiple uses extend the duration. The save DC is Charisma-based.</p></section></div>"
      }
